      <p>Moving money to Spain doesn't have to be expensive. Traditional banks charge steep fees and offer poor exchange rates—Wise (TransferWise) and Revolut offer far better deals. Whether you're sending living expenses monthly, paying for property, or transferring savings, this guide shows you how to save hundreds of euros annually.</p>
